## On the job {.unnumbered}

::: callout-important
## Why this matters day to day

Your engagement survey, your attrition figures, your last headcount
report — all of it is **one sample**. Everything you report is an
estimate that would have come out a little differently with a
different group of respondents or a different month. That's the
difference between "engagement is down" and the honest, defensible
version: *"engagement is down in this survey, by roughly this much,
give or take this much."*
:::

